                                                    "text": "snippet for jit.grab and various menus\n\nits a camera input\nyou have menus for choosing the device and the default resolutions\n\nthe texture output toggle forces a texture output (blue cable), this is usefull when using the camera only for visual FX, but if you need to analyze it for movement, flow, blob, white tracking, or any interactive process, leave it with texture-output off, meaning the output will be a matrix (green cable)"
